│ decision making around quality of care. There are clearly a number of challenges to effectively developing the       │
│ process of community representation in hospital governance, associated with ambiguity, organisational and consumer   │
│ issues. For an inclusive agenda to real life, work must be done on understanding the representatives\' role and the  │
│ decision making process, adequately supporting the representational process, and developing organisational           │
│ cooperation and culture regarding community representation."}, {"study_index": 291, "title": "Development and        │
