│ similar endeavors in other jurisdictions."}, {"study_index": 295, "title": "The implementation road: engaging        │
│ community partnerships in evidence-based cancer control interventions", "abstract": "Southern rural and underserved  │
│ counties have high proportions of individuals with increased mortality for cervical and breast cancers. To improve   │
│ the integration of behavioral research into practice, the dissemination and implementation of efficacious            │
│ interventions to encourage the use of screening have increased in recent years. This study addressed gaps in the     │
│ dissemination and implementation of evidence-based interventions with a pilot called Team Up. Qualitative interviews │
